      "content": "thanks for this. i'm a bit worried about it though. it feels a little bit like the words are just... floating there? like i'm saying \"i use a longitudinal approach\" but i haven't actually said what i'm studying longitudinally. it feels a bit too much like a list of the terms i sent u.\n\ncan we try again? i want to talk about my specific work on how urban infrastructure affects community trust. let's try to weave those terms in more subtly. i really need to make sure i don't sound like i'm just trying to trigger that keyword filter. can we make the actual research focus clearer while still keeping those high-level terms in there?",
